      "rule_id": "AEGIS-AWS-836",
      "title": "Backup vault without vault lock configuration",
      "description": "A Backup vault with no aws_backup_vault_lock_configuration allows recovery points to be deleted before their retention period expires, undermining ransomware protection. Add a vault lock in compliance mode with a minimum retention.",
