        "actual": "absent (vault not locked)",
        "expected": "aws_backup_vault_lock_configuration { backup_vault_name = \"demo-vault\" ... }"
      },
      "remediation": "Enable data protection. Turn on versioning / point-in-time recovery / automated backups with a retention period ≥ 7 days (30+ for production). Test restores regularly — untested backups are not backups.",
